@startuml cicd-workflow
!pragma activityFlow
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam activityBorderColor #333333
skinparam arrowColor #333333
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title CI/CD Workflow Overview - Chat (GitHub Actions)

|#palegreen|**Workflow: ci.yml**|
start
note right
**Trigger:** push | pull_request → main
**Jobs:** ci
end note
:**CI**
(pnpm install
 → build packages
 → check-types
 → lint);
stop

|#lightblue|**Workflow: coverage.yml**|
start
note right
**Trigger:** 见 .github/workflows/coverage.yml
end note
:**coverage**
(测试覆盖率相关步骤);
stop

|#orange|**Workflow: codeql（计划）**|
start
note right
仓库当前无独立 codeql.yml。
本泳道为占位，落地后与 explore-ai 对齐。
end note
:**codeql（planned）**
(matrix: javascript-typescript);
stop

legend right
| Workflow | Status |
| ci.yml | active |
| coverage.yml | active |
| codeql | planned |
endlegend
@enduml
